Hmm, actually, maybe the mock stores committed_count as str(controller_count) always — a deliberate "bug". Then the ONLY way to get confirm == committed is to change controller_count to a string "3" at creation. But create seems to be a fixed template that doesn't store anything new (existing plan persists).

